So think of it kind of like if this player wants to host a lobby, they need to talk to the signaling server to host that lobby.

21
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:48,480
是你的专用服务器负责保存用户信息。
It is your dedicated server that holds on to your user information.

22
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:53,200
它保存哪些大厅是开放的，这些大厅里有多少人，诸如此类的。
It holds on to what lobbies are open, how many people are in those lobbies, things like that.

